1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 40=

4
00:02:58,260 --> 00:03:00,100
(I made)

5
00:03:01,940 --> 00:03:03,900
(many mistakes in my life,)

6
00:03:05,580 --> 00:03:07,460
(and lost someone along the way.)

7
00:03:25,780 --> 00:03:26,900
(But now,)

8
00:03:28,460 --> 00:03:29,700
(it's too late for regrets.)

9
00:03:33,620 --> 00:03:35,140
(I've roamed half my life,)

10
00:03:36,540 --> 00:03:38,180
(and I've only ever surrendered once.)

11
00:03:39,740 --> 00:03:40,740
(And that was agreeing)

12
00:03:41,740 --> 00:03:42,980
(to be your husband.)

13
00:04:14,460 --> 00:04:15,420
(Everything)

14
00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:20,980
(can finally come to an end.)

15
00:05:00,380 --> 00:05:01,660
Your Royal Highness, Yang Si is dead!

16
00:05:07,780 --> 00:05:08,980
Yang Si is dead?

17
00:05:13,100 --> 00:05:13,660
That's impossible.

18
00:05:14,700 --> 00:05:15,860
It's a trick.

19
00:05:17,060 --> 00:05:18,060
It was Mu Wanyao.

20
00:05:18,940 --> 00:05:20,220
It's Mu Wanyao lying to me.

21
00:05:21,180 --> 00:05:21,700
Yang Si

22
00:05:23,540 --> 00:05:24,540
can't be dead.

23
00:06:00,180 --> 00:06:00,940
I will

24
00:06:01,860 --> 00:06:03,220
take Sheng'an tonight!

25
00:06:04,220 --> 00:06:05,460
Only forward.

26
00:06:06,380 --> 00:06:07,580
Those who retreat

27
00:06:08,380 --> 00:06:09,260
die!

28
00:06:13,460 --> 00:06:14,580
We must hold the city!

29
00:06:18,580 --> 00:06:19,180
Commander Yan!

30
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:22,060
Commander Yan.

31
00:06:24,260 --> 00:06:24,820
Commander Yan.

32
00:06:24,820 --> 00:06:25,940
It's really Commander Yan.

33
00:06:26,100 --> 00:06:26,420
Commander Yan.

34
00:06:26,420 --> 00:06:27,700
He's back. We're saved.

35
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:30,420
Commander Yan!

36
00:06:31,460 --> 00:06:32,420
It's really Commander Yan.

37
00:06:32,700 --> 00:06:34,180
Now we can hold the city.

38
00:06:57,580 --> 00:06:58,580
Commander Yan is still alive?

39
00:07:10,260 --> 00:07:10,940
Young man,

40
00:07:12,340 --> 00:07:13,180
where are you from?

41
00:07:13,740 --> 00:07:14,500
Commander Yan.

42
00:07:15,220 --> 00:07:15,820
Longyou Circuit.

43
00:07:22,180 --> 00:07:22,580
And you?

44
00:07:22,820 --> 00:07:23,700
I'm from Wanlian County.

45
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:26,580
Sizhou, Qianzhong Circuit.

46
00:07:28,300 --> 00:07:29,260
I'm from Lyumin!

47
00:07:30,620 --> 00:07:31,740
I'm from Shan County!

48
00:07:34,740 --> 00:07:35,900
I'm from Daizhou!

49
00:07:37,100 --> 00:07:38,020
I'm from Langzhong.

50
00:07:38,020 --> 00:07:38,780
I'm from Hannan.

51
00:07:38,780 --> 00:07:39,780
I'm from Hexi.

52
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:45,940
I'm from Jiangnan!

53
00:07:58,260 --> 00:07:58,860
I'm from

54
00:07:59,620 --> 00:08:01,860
Santu County, Lingnan Circuit.

55
00:08:10,140 --> 00:08:11,980
All troops, hear my command!

56
00:08:12,460 --> 00:08:13,460
Here!

57
00:08:16,980 --> 00:08:17,820
Sally forth.

58
00:08:20,140 --> 00:08:22,500
Wipe out the enemy!

59
00:08:22,940 --> 00:08:24,220
Yes, sir!

60
00:09:19,900 --> 00:09:21,020
Kill!

61
00:10:11,700 --> 00:10:16,220
♪So many clever schemes
with a fan's wave♪

62
00:10:17,060 --> 00:10:23,740
♪Standing with kindred spirits, united
against our foes to bring an end to war♪

63
00:10:23,900 --> 00:10:28,900
♪Someday, we'll sail and feed the gulls♪

64
00:10:29,060 --> 00:10:34,420
♪Gaze upon the land
and guard it with you♪

65
00:10:35,940 --> 00:10:41,980
♪Trading fine wine for a blade;
dreaming beneath the moon in a tower♪

66
00:10:42,060 --> 00:10:48,100
♪I'd trade all the world's romance
for one moment of tenderness♪

67
00:10:50,660 --> 00:10:54,980
♪Whose eyes have seen
the smoke of war?♪

68
00:10:55,020 --> 00:10:58,260
♪I'll ride into battle♪

69
00:10:58,340 --> 00:11:02,340
♪Blood stains my sleeves as I
stand firm. Never will I fall behind♪

70
00:11:02,900 --> 00:11:07,140
♪I bow beyond the frontier walls♪

71
00:11:07,340 --> 00:11:12,650
♪May you live a life free of sorrow;
may the moon shine on us forever♪

72
00:11:12,650 --> 00:11:18,380
♪May you live a life free of sorrow;
may the moon shine on us forever♪

73
00:11:27,500 --> 00:11:27,980
Mu Xun.

74
00:11:39,820 --> 00:11:40,420
You've lost.

75
00:12:01,820 --> 00:12:07,020
(Peace Throughout the Realm)

76
00:12:09,380 --> 00:12:10,300
Sheng'an is so close.

77
00:12:10,300 --> 00:12:11,060
Sheng'an is so close.

78
00:12:14,540 --> 00:12:15,940
Yet I could never return.

79
00:12:41,900 --> 00:12:42,340
I

80
00:12:44,300 --> 00:12:46,660
am the rightful heir of Huai!

81
00:12:47,180 --> 00:12:48,020
(Peace Throughout the Realm)

82
00:13:00,660 --> 00:13:02,060
I've earned my merit!

83
00:13:03,180 --> 00:13:04,740
I've earned my merit!

84
00:13:05,660 --> 00:13:08,020
I've earned my merit!

85
00:13:08,420 --> 00:13:10,620
I've earned my merit!

86
00:13:10,900 --> 00:13:12,500
I've earned my merit!

87
00:13:15,820 --> 00:13:17,020
Commander Yan! Commander Yan!

88
00:13:17,380 --> 00:13:17,940
Are you all right?

89
00:13:17,940 --> 00:13:18,540
Are you okay?

90
00:13:36,180 --> 00:13:36,700
(Your Highness.)

91
00:13:37,740 --> 00:13:39,100
(You haven't finished)

92
00:13:39,860 --> 00:13:40,700
(telling me your story.)

93
00:13:42,460 --> 00:13:43,460
(The ending)

94
00:13:44,340 --> 00:13:45,420
(wasn't anything special.)

95
00:13:47,500 --> 00:13:48,540
(The fire rose)

96
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:51,420
(and burned them all to ashes.)

97
00:13:53,420 --> 00:13:54,620
(The wood ash and molten iron)

98
00:13:55,740 --> 00:13:57,340
(embraced in the earth,)

99
00:13:59,180 --> 00:14:00,060
(forging)

100
00:14:01,460 --> 00:14:02,860
(unbreakable steel.)

101
00:14:05,100 --> 00:14:08,720
♪Defy its might,
and the submission it demands♪

102
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:12,180
♪Defy its might,
and the submission it demands♪

103
00:14:12,300 --> 00:14:15,940
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

104
00:14:15,940 --> 00:14:19,460
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

105
00:14:19,940 --> 00:14:23,940
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

106
00:14:24,020 --> 00:14:26,540
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

107
00:14:26,700 --> 00:14:30,220
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

108
00:14:30,540 --> 00:14:34,060
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

109
00:14:34,100 --> 00:14:38,340
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

110
00:14:38,460 --> 00:14:40,980
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

111
00:14:41,060 --> 00:14:44,180
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

112
00:14:44,300 --> 00:14:47,420
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

113
00:14:48,100 --> 00:14:52,140
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

114
00:14:52,660 --> 00:14:55,460
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

115
00:14:55,500 --> 00:15:01,740
♪Through fire, I'll turn the
dark towers bright as day for you♪

116
00:15:02,420 --> 00:15:06,180
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

117
00:15:06,300 --> 00:15:09,380
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

118
00:15:11,220 --> 00:15:11,860
(Iron said,)

119
00:15:13,660 --> 00:15:14,260
("How wonderful.")

120
00:15:16,180 --> 00:15:17,260
("We've met again.")

121
00:15:19,540 --> 00:15:23,340
♪They gave me this life
without asking me♪

122
00:15:23,820 --> 00:15:26,900
♪If I can't decide what to do with it♪

123
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:33,260
♪I might as well use it to light a fire
and burn the darkness into daylight♪

124
00:15:33,620 --> 00:15:37,420
♪You're my princess,
and I'll take you away♪

125
00:15:37,540 --> 00:15:40,620
♪In this life, we'll bow
only to flowers♪

126
00:15:40,860 --> 00:15:46,700
♪Fierce and radiant,
red lips and dark eyes♪

127
00:15:46,980 --> 00:15:51,060
♪Together we'll climb the city walls♪

128
00:16:13,780 --> 00:16:15,540
(The young Emperor Chun ascended
the throne.)

129
00:16:16,060 --> 00:16:18,860
(The Grand Princess Regent holds
the reins of government.)

130
00:16:19,540 --> 00:16:22,220
(Yan Shang, Head of the Secretariat,
leads the court.)

131
00:16:22,380 --> 00:16:23,580
(With ruler and ministers united,)

132
00:16:23,900 --> 00:16:26,580
(a golden age began.)

133
00:18:07,420 --> 00:18:14,100
(Three years later,
Princess Danyang's Residence)

134
00:18:44,660 --> 00:18:45,380
(As a child,)

135
00:18:46,700 --> 00:18:48,620
(I used to imagine my wedding day.)

136
00:18:50,300 --> 00:18:50,980
(Later,)

137
00:18:52,220 --> 00:18:54,380
(I thought I'd never want to marry.)

138
00:19:15,500 --> 00:19:17,900
May you share a long and happy life,
Head of the Secretariat!

139
00:19:18,060 --> 00:19:20,060
(I never thought I'd be lucky enough)

140
00:19:20,860 --> 00:19:22,220
(to marry her in this life.)

141
00:19:36,380 --> 00:19:37,060
Shang!

142
00:19:37,820 --> 00:19:38,660
Shang!

143
00:19:39,940 --> 00:19:40,740
Father, look at Shang.

144
00:19:44,380 --> 00:19:45,340
Isn't my brother handsome?

145
00:20:42,420 --> 00:20:43,740
The newlyweds bow to each other.

146
00:21:02,460 --> 00:21:03,900
The mirror knots are joined.

147
00:21:35,540 --> 00:21:36,860
The wedding cups are joined.

148
00:21:37,500 --> 00:21:38,700
May your love stay as true as ever.

149
00:22:14,540 --> 00:22:17,900
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

150
00:22:18,020 --> 00:22:21,580
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

151
00:22:21,700 --> 00:22:28,620
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

152
00:22:28,820 --> 00:22:30,700
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

153
00:22:30,700 --> 00:22:33,340
♪- May time be free of pain
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

154
00:22:33,380 --> 00:22:35,940
♪You're the only one I need♪

155
00:22:35,980 --> 00:22:42,300
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

156
00:22:42,300 --> 00:22:43,540
Today, this joyous union is celebrated.

157
00:22:43,820 --> 00:22:45,060
Heaven and earth bear witness.

158
00:22:45,740 --> 00:22:46,540
The ceremony is complete.

159
00:22:46,620 --> 00:22:50,060
♪My last untouched innocence♪

160
00:22:50,380 --> 00:22:53,820
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

161
00:22:54,100 --> 00:22:57,500
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

162
00:22:57,660 --> 00:23:04,540
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

163
00:23:04,700 --> 00:23:06,580
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

164
00:23:06,580 --> 00:23:09,220
♪- May time be free of pain
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

165
00:23:09,380 --> 00:23:11,900
♪You're the only one I need♪

166
00:23:11,940 --> 00:23:15,200
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

167
00:23:15,200 --> 00:23:19,100
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

168
00:23:19,180 --> 00:23:22,540
♪- Till fireworks flood the town
- Till the lake is still and clear♪

169
00:23:22,620 --> 00:23:26,020
♪The wind blows past us♪

170
00:23:26,300 --> 00:23:30,940
♪- If there's still
- Some warmth left in this world♪

171
00:23:31,660 --> 00:23:36,060
♪You're the only one I need♪

172
00:23:47,900 --> 00:23:52,820
(Yan Family, Lingnan)

173
00:24:22,740 --> 00:24:23,100
Look.

174
00:24:23,900 --> 00:24:25,260
That's how the rice grains come out.

175
00:24:27,700 --> 00:24:28,900
Rice really is falling out.

176
00:24:29,420 --> 00:24:30,220
Want to try, Si'er?

177
00:24:30,740 --> 00:24:31,100
Sure.

178
00:24:33,620 --> 00:24:34,340
Come over here.

179
00:24:35,700 --> 00:24:36,140
Hold it.

180
00:24:36,860 --> 00:24:37,900
One, two, three.

181
00:24:38,740 --> 00:24:39,020
Come on.

182
00:24:46,740 --> 00:24:46,980
Come on.

183
00:24:47,700 --> 00:24:48,500
Up. Down.

184
00:24:54,500 --> 00:24:55,980
See, the grains are all flying out.

185
00:24:57,060 --> 00:24:57,700
Let's take a break.

186
00:25:01,460 --> 00:25:03,140
Freshly peeled, Your Majesty.
Nice and juicy.

187
00:25:03,260 --> 00:25:03,620
Try it.

188
00:25:08,980 --> 00:25:09,780
I can't bite through it.

189
00:25:11,260 --> 00:25:13,060
I'll make you sugarcane juice in a bit.

190
00:25:13,420 --> 00:25:14,820
once all your permanent teeth come in,

191
00:25:15,260 --> 00:25:16,740
you'll be able to bite through it
quickly and easily.

192
00:25:20,500 --> 00:25:21,260
Sir,

193
00:25:21,860 --> 00:25:24,140
is this the rice we usually eat?

194
00:25:24,500 --> 00:25:26,260
It doesn't look quite the same.

195
00:25:27,540 --> 00:25:28,260
We're far from done.

196
00:25:29,100 --> 00:25:30,100
Once the rice ears are threshed,

197
00:25:30,620 --> 00:25:31,540
they still need to be spread out

198
00:25:32,100 --> 00:25:33,020
to winnow off the husks.

199
00:25:33,460 --> 00:25:34,700
Then milling and pounding.

200
00:25:34,940 --> 00:25:36,740
Sifting out the chaff
and grinding off the bran.

201
00:25:37,300 --> 00:25:39,100
Only then can it be cooked and served

202
00:25:39,460 --> 00:25:40,540
at your table, Your Majesty.

203
00:25:40,980 --> 00:25:42,300
That's a lot of work.

204
00:25:42,860 --> 00:25:44,620
There's even more work before threshing.

205
00:25:45,060 --> 00:25:46,980
You have to plow the fields,
sow the seeds,

206
00:25:47,300 --> 00:25:49,460
transplant the seedlings,
channel the water, and pull the weeds.

207
00:25:50,020 --> 00:25:51,500
You have to work until the grain ripens.

208
00:25:51,940 --> 00:25:54,300
Only then can you thresh and dry it,
just as we're doing now.

209
00:25:57,700 --> 00:25:59,500
Last month, you asked me

210
00:25:59,780 --> 00:26:01,860
what the ministers always mean

211
00:26:02,220 --> 00:26:03,300
by "Sheji."

212
00:26:03,700 --> 00:26:04,180
I told you

213
00:26:04,660 --> 00:26:06,700
that "She" is the god of the land,

214
00:26:07,180 --> 00:26:07,940
who nurtures all things.

215
00:26:08,580 --> 00:26:10,540
"Ji" is the god of grain,

216
00:26:11,100 --> 00:26:12,020
who feeds the people.

217
00:26:13,260 --> 00:26:15,380
So "Sheji"

218
00:26:15,900 --> 00:26:18,380
means the gods who protect
our land and crops?

219
00:26:18,940 --> 00:26:19,620
No.

220
00:26:20,420 --> 00:26:21,940
The gods can't grow grain.

221
00:26:22,420 --> 00:26:22,980
Aunt!

222
00:26:26,580 --> 00:26:28,140
Gods don't plow a single field,

223
00:26:28,420 --> 00:26:29,180
don't weave a chi of cloth,

224
00:26:29,940 --> 00:26:31,540
and certainly don't guard
the borders for us.

225
00:26:32,860 --> 00:26:34,900
Si'er, who truly grows

226
00:26:35,340 --> 00:26:36,300
our crops

227
00:26:36,620 --> 00:26:36,980
and protects our land?

228
00:26:42,580 --> 00:26:43,220
It's the people.

229
00:26:43,740 --> 00:26:44,900
I saw them all along the way.

230
00:26:45,220 --> 00:26:46,980
Commoners working in the fields.

231
00:26:47,380 --> 00:26:49,020
Women weaving cloth in the villages.

232
00:26:49,340 --> 00:26:51,620
So many soldiers guarding
the city walls.

233
00:26:59,660 --> 00:27:00,460
Xiaozhou, you're back.

234
00:27:00,580 --> 00:27:01,380
Where are Father and Dalang?

235
00:27:01,700 --> 00:27:02,380
Still at the charity school?

236
00:27:02,980 --> 00:27:05,260
Don't even ask.
Father sent me back to fetch the ruler.

237
00:27:05,820 --> 00:27:07,180
He was teaching the children
to recite today

238
00:27:07,180 --> 00:27:08,340
and got furious.

239
00:27:08,500 --> 00:27:08,860
He shouted,

240
00:27:09,300 --> 00:27:11,260
"How dumb can one be not to memorize
the Thousand Character Classic?"

241
00:27:11,580 --> 00:27:13,220
Dalang was too scared to say a word.

242
00:27:15,540 --> 00:27:17,500
Aunt, what's a charity school?

243
00:27:19,140 --> 00:27:19,620
Xiaozhou.

244
00:27:20,820 --> 00:27:22,740
Could you take Si'er to see
the charity school?

245
00:27:23,380 --> 00:27:23,740
Sure.

246
00:27:24,580 --> 00:27:25,900
Can I come too?

247
00:27:26,500 --> 00:27:27,060
I...

248
00:27:27,660 --> 00:27:28,660
I can recite
the Thousand Character Classic.

249
00:27:29,380 --> 00:27:29,700
Let's go.

250
00:27:30,580 --> 00:27:30,980
Go ahead.

251
00:27:30,980 --> 00:27:31,300
Go on.

252
00:27:32,180 --> 00:27:32,620
Come on, Si'er.

253
00:27:46,820 --> 00:27:47,500
Head of the Secretariat.

254
00:27:48,100 --> 00:27:48,420
Come here.

255
00:27:53,260 --> 00:27:53,700
Your Highness.

256
00:28:28,020 --> 00:28:29,420
I haven't walked far,

257
00:28:30,060 --> 00:28:31,260
but I'm already exhausted.

258
00:28:34,300 --> 00:28:35,620
I'll take you back to rest,

259
00:28:36,500 --> 00:28:37,220
Your Highness.

260
00:29:03,300 --> 00:29:04,660
Your Highness,
what would you like for dinner?

261
00:29:06,100 --> 00:29:07,460
When in Rome.

262
00:29:07,780 --> 00:29:08,460
We'll eat

263
00:29:08,460 --> 00:29:09,380
whatever they have here.

264
00:29:14,220 --> 00:29:14,940
Look.

265
00:29:15,500 --> 00:29:16,580
The book says

266
00:29:16,980 --> 00:29:19,100
besides lychee wine,

267
00:29:19,780 --> 00:29:20,620
Lingnan also has green plums.

268
00:29:21,700 --> 00:29:23,380
So green plum wine?

269
00:29:26,220 --> 00:29:27,900
And some cured meat from here.

270
00:29:28,900 --> 00:29:29,460
All right then.

271
00:30:49,340 --> 00:30:51,460
Harvest in autumn, store for winter.

272
00:30:55,980 --> 00:30:56,980
Fruit wine.

273
00:30:57,380 --> 00:30:58,060
Want to try some?

274
00:30:58,620 --> 00:30:59,100
A bit sour.

275
00:30:59,380 --> 00:30:59,940
But it's fine.

276
00:31:02,180 --> 00:31:06,100
♪Where endless time comes to an end♪

277
00:31:06,100 --> 00:31:10,340
♪Moonlight and breeze fill
our boat home♪

278
00:31:10,420 --> 00:31:14,520
♪Golden winds and jade dew return♪

279
00:31:14,520 --> 00:31:18,940
♪The world still blooms as before♪

280
00:31:19,060 --> 00:31:23,120
♪How lucky to roam with you♪

281
00:31:23,120 --> 00:31:27,260
♪Back to the road where it all began♪

282
00:31:27,780 --> 00:31:32,020
♪As if our youthful hearts remain♪

283
00:31:32,100 --> 00:31:36,180
♪As if our love will never fade♪

284
00:31:36,300 --> 00:31:43,020
♪Chasing clouds by boat,
carefree and unbound♪

285
00:31:54,140 --> 00:31:54,580
This fish

286
00:31:55,220 --> 00:31:55,940
looks delicious.

287
00:31:56,460 --> 00:31:57,220
Have some of this big fish.

288
00:31:57,900 --> 00:31:58,780
How about a bite?

289
00:31:58,780 --> 00:31:59,180
Here, Shang.

290
00:31:59,340 --> 00:31:59,780
Want to try?

291
00:32:00,580 --> 00:32:01,420
Let's have a drink together.

292
00:32:02,980 --> 00:32:04,460
First, a toast to Wanyao.

293
00:32:05,740 --> 00:32:06,060
Wanyao.

294
00:32:07,020 --> 00:32:07,580
A toast to you.

295
00:32:12,460 --> 00:32:13,180
I'll drink tea instead.

296
00:32:13,940 --> 00:32:14,340
Here.

297
00:32:17,860 --> 00:32:18,340
Come on.

298
00:32:18,660 --> 00:32:19,500
- Shang, Wanyao.
- Dig in.

299
00:32:19,700 --> 00:32:21,100
Is the food to your liking?

300
00:32:21,500 --> 00:32:22,020
Delicious.

301
00:32:22,540 --> 00:32:23,780
This is a Lingnan specialty,

302
00:32:23,980 --> 00:32:25,140
pork offal soup with amomum.

303
00:32:25,340 --> 00:32:26,100
Be sure to have some.

304
00:32:26,620 --> 00:32:26,900
Wanyao,

305
00:32:27,300 --> 00:32:27,940
let me get you a bowl.

306
00:32:35,300 --> 00:32:35,620
Try it.

307
00:32:38,260 --> 00:32:38,780
It smells wonderful.

308
00:32:40,860 --> 00:32:42,900
Do you remember when we first met,

309
00:32:42,900 --> 00:32:44,220
and you pinned me down?

310
00:32:44,500 --> 00:32:45,020
Remember?

311
00:32:45,020 --> 00:32:45,780
Let's not bring that up.

312
00:32:46,300 --> 00:32:46,820
Let this drink

313
00:32:47,020 --> 00:32:47,980
be my apology.

314
00:32:48,420 --> 00:32:49,580
When you come to Sheng'an someday,

315
00:32:49,820 --> 00:32:52,020
I'll show you its fine food and wine

316
00:32:52,260 --> 00:32:52,900
and its bustling sights.

317
00:32:53,340 --> 00:32:53,660
Bottoms up.

318
00:32:54,180 --> 00:32:55,220
You'd better keep your word.

319
00:32:58,860 --> 00:32:59,500
Of course.

320
00:32:59,900 --> 00:33:00,380
Bottoms up!

321
00:33:01,380 --> 00:33:03,860
When we sat for the imperial exams,

322
00:33:04,380 --> 00:33:05,100
Sheng'an

323
00:33:06,380 --> 00:33:07,340
was nothing

324
00:33:07,340 --> 00:33:09,220
like the place you describe today.

325
00:33:10,620 --> 00:33:12,260
What was Sheng'an like back then?

326
00:33:12,620 --> 00:33:13,900
What changed it?

327
00:33:17,180 --> 00:33:19,260
That is

328
00:33:20,940 --> 00:33:21,980
a very long story.

329
00:33:58,020 --> 00:33:58,500
Good thing.

330
00:34:00,100 --> 00:34:00,780
We didn't miss it.

331
00:34:05,620 --> 00:34:06,180
Good thing.

332
00:34:07,260 --> 00:34:08,220
We didn't miss each other.

333
00:34:09,820 --> 00:34:10,940
How could we ever miss each other?

334
00:34:12,020 --> 00:34:14,460
You're the only one of your kind
in this world.

335
00:34:15,420 --> 00:34:16,820
I won't let you go so easily.

336
00:34:18,460 --> 00:34:18,900
That's right.

337
00:34:19,980 --> 00:34:21,100
We were meant to be together.

338
00:34:22,100 --> 00:34:23,140
Together,
we'll ascend to the highest heavens.

339
00:34:24,020 --> 00:34:25,100
Together,
we'll descend to the deepest hell.

340
00:34:26,460 --> 00:34:27,820
Together, we'll be immortal lovers.

341
00:34:28,540 --> 00:34:30,860
Together, we'll be vengeful demons.

342
00:34:42,260 --> 00:34:44,060
Back then, when I was lost
in the mountains,

343
00:34:44,940 --> 00:34:45,700
everything

344
00:34:46,300 --> 00:34:48,740
seemed terrifying.
Danger lurked at every turn.

345
00:34:50,380 --> 00:34:51,860
Now, so much time has passed.

346
00:34:52,620 --> 00:34:53,460
Looking back,

347
00:34:54,020 --> 00:34:55,140
it all seems like a beautiful painting.

348
00:34:56,780 --> 00:34:57,300
Yan Shang.

349
00:34:57,900 --> 00:34:59,220
Were you

350
00:35:00,060 --> 00:35:01,940
ever afraid when you first came

351
00:35:02,540 --> 00:35:03,500
to the mountains of Lingnan?

352
00:35:07,660 --> 00:35:08,900
At first, I didn't dare walk alone.

353
00:35:09,900 --> 00:35:11,780
Any sound or movement

354
00:35:13,140 --> 00:35:13,860
startled me.

355
00:35:15,100 --> 00:35:15,700
Later,

356
00:35:16,300 --> 00:35:17,380
I stopped being afraid.

357
00:35:18,140 --> 00:35:19,220
I traveled to and from my studies
every day.

358
00:35:19,700 --> 00:35:21,020
The mountains changed with the seasons.

359
00:35:23,260 --> 00:35:24,580
There was endless scenery to take in.

360
00:35:43,580 --> 00:35:44,500
You brought me wine?

361
00:35:46,220 --> 00:35:48,780
With such fine weather, beautiful
scenery, and so much free time,

362
00:35:49,260 --> 00:35:49,940
how could we go without wine?

363
00:35:50,900 --> 00:35:51,940
The lychee harvest was good this year.

364
00:35:52,220 --> 00:35:53,260
Xiaozhou brewed a few extra jars.

365
00:35:53,940 --> 00:35:54,820
Enough for you to take back

366
00:35:55,540 --> 00:35:56,100
and drink for a while.

367
00:35:57,020 --> 00:35:57,820
Strange.

368
00:35:58,420 --> 00:35:59,460
Back in the palace,

369
00:35:59,940 --> 00:36:02,020
you'd always find a way

370
00:36:02,500 --> 00:36:03,580
to talk me into drinking less.

371
00:36:05,580 --> 00:36:06,660
This is Lingnan.

372
00:36:07,740 --> 00:36:08,660
I have a selfish reason.

373
00:36:10,460 --> 00:36:11,020
Really?

374
00:36:11,940 --> 00:36:14,980
Even the most upright and proper
Head of the Secretariat in all of Huai

375
00:36:15,980 --> 00:36:17,340
has a selfish side?

376
00:36:21,380 --> 00:36:22,060
I hope

377
00:36:22,660 --> 00:36:23,380
that at least here,

378
00:36:24,140 --> 00:36:25,580
you can do as you please
and enjoy yourself.

379
00:36:26,300 --> 00:36:27,380
If you want to drink, then drink.

380
00:36:27,900 --> 00:36:28,420
If you get drunk,

381
00:36:29,140 --> 00:36:30,500
sleep till the sun's high.

382
00:36:38,020 --> 00:36:39,180
We need

383
00:36:40,020 --> 00:36:42,260
a few days like this now and then.

384
00:36:43,180 --> 00:36:44,220
That gives us the strength

385
00:36:45,140 --> 00:36:46,300
to keep working.

386
00:36:52,140 --> 00:36:53,180
Actually,

387
00:36:53,940 --> 00:36:55,020
when I woke

388
00:36:55,620 --> 00:36:56,660
from my nap that day,

389
00:36:57,980 --> 00:36:59,340
for a little while,

390
00:37:00,220 --> 00:37:02,460
I couldn't remember what day it was

391
00:37:02,900 --> 00:37:03,860
or where I was.

392
00:37:05,500 --> 00:37:07,980
It was as if I'd just been sleeping
in the palace study

393
00:37:08,500 --> 00:37:09,900
piled with memorials,

394
00:37:11,220 --> 00:37:12,020
or

395
00:37:12,580 --> 00:37:14,180
in the lofty tower of my residence.

396
00:37:15,260 --> 00:37:15,860
Then

397
00:37:16,700 --> 00:37:18,940
I remembered I was in Lingnan.

398
00:37:19,540 --> 00:37:21,100
I was so happy.

399
00:37:26,420 --> 00:37:27,220
Tomorrow,

400
00:37:28,420 --> 00:37:29,900
it's time to head back to Sheng'an.

401
00:37:33,380 --> 00:37:33,900
Do you

402
00:37:34,660 --> 00:37:35,740
want to delay our return?

403
00:37:36,460 --> 00:37:37,340
Of course not.

404
00:37:38,380 --> 00:37:39,300
We haven't exactly been idle

405
00:37:39,820 --> 00:37:40,860
on this trip.

406
00:37:41,540 --> 00:37:42,300
Who knows

407
00:37:42,620 --> 00:37:44,340
how much work will be waiting
for us back there.

408
00:37:45,540 --> 00:37:47,140
Winter is only a few months away.

409
00:37:47,780 --> 00:37:48,620
I wonder

410
00:37:48,980 --> 00:37:50,580
if Longyou's granaries
are fully stocked.

411
00:37:51,260 --> 00:37:53,700
The envoy from the Caliphate arrives
early next month.

412
00:37:54,300 --> 00:37:55,580
The Court of State Ceremonial
will be busy.

413
00:37:56,180 --> 00:37:57,500
The records
from the Bureau of Evaluations

414
00:37:57,700 --> 00:37:58,860
should be arriving this year too.

415
00:37:59,020 --> 00:38:00,140
- All right.
- And...

416
00:38:04,420 --> 00:38:05,260
Tomorrow

417
00:38:07,020 --> 00:38:08,020
is another day.

418
00:38:09,900 --> 00:38:14,780
♪Let me be the fireflies dancing
across your brow♪

419
00:38:16,940 --> 00:38:22,300
♪Let me hold you
whenever the rain falls♪

420
00:38:22,420 --> 00:38:27,020
♪- Together we'll soar to the skies
- Together we'll turn to ashes♪

421
00:38:27,020 --> 00:38:32,300
♪- Burning bright as a song
- Two shadows entwined, a beautiful sight♪

422
00:38:32,380 --> 00:38:37,380
♪Be the vow I whisper again and again♪

423
00:38:37,420 --> 00:38:42,220
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

424
00:38:42,260 --> 00:38:44,100
♪Not a single hour less♪

425
00:38:44,140 --> 00:38:47,940
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

426
00:38:47,940 --> 00:38:51,900
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

427
00:38:52,020 --> 00:38:55,340
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

428
00:38:55,500 --> 00:38:58,980
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

429
00:38:59,220 --> 00:39:05,980
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

430
00:39:06,340 --> 00:39:08,180
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

431
00:39:08,180 --> 00:39:10,740
♪- May time be free of pain
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

432
00:39:10,900 --> 00:39:13,300
♪You're the only one I need♪

433
00:39:13,460 --> 00:39:17,100
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

434
00:39:17,100 --> 00:39:20,580
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

435
00:39:20,660 --> 00:39:23,980
♪- Be my one and only in this world
- Be my one and only in this life♪

436
00:39:24,100 --> 00:39:25,940
♪My last untouched innocence♪

437
00:39:25,940 --> 00:39:27,460
Thus, Heaven does not speak.

438
00:39:28,100 --> 00:39:30,380
It shows its will
through deeds and actions.

439
00:39:31,420 --> 00:39:32,580
One might ask,

440
00:39:33,220 --> 00:39:35,740
"Recommend a man to Heaven,
and Heaven accepts him."

441
00:39:36,380 --> 00:39:39,180
"Reveal him to the people,
and the people accept him."

442
00:39:39,460 --> 00:39:40,020
"How so?"

443
00:39:42,980 --> 00:39:43,460
How so?

444
00:39:45,100 --> 00:39:47,020
Mother, you drifted off again.

445
00:39:47,780 --> 00:39:48,820
I'm listening.

446
00:39:49,100 --> 00:39:49,780
Go on.

447
00:39:50,460 --> 00:39:53,060
What did the passage
I just recited mean?

448
00:39:54,300 --> 00:39:56,380
It means...

449
00:40:00,860 --> 00:40:01,660
I don't know.

450
00:40:02,340 --> 00:40:04,420
I already explained it to you last time.

451
00:40:05,140 --> 00:40:06,060
I forgot.

452
00:40:07,300 --> 00:40:08,460
Aunt.

453
00:40:10,620 --> 00:40:11,820
I have things to attend to.

454
00:40:12,420 --> 00:40:13,620
You'd better study hard.

455
00:40:15,540 --> 00:40:16,620
Your Highness, don't go!

456
00:40:17,060 --> 00:40:17,900
You're not staying with me?

457
00:40:19,220 --> 00:40:20,940
Mother, pay attention.

458
00:40:22,140 --> 00:40:22,860
I am listening.

459
00:40:30,540 --> 00:40:31,540
Are you fleeing for your life?

460
00:40:32,820 --> 00:40:34,700
Si'er is teaching Chunhua the Mencius.

461
00:40:34,900 --> 00:40:36,140
And he insists I supervise.

462
00:40:36,940 --> 00:40:38,540
With the little learning Chunhua has,

463
00:40:39,020 --> 00:40:40,140
how could she possibly understand it?

464
00:40:40,940 --> 00:40:43,300
Si'er is nearly in tears
from frustration.

465
00:40:43,780 --> 00:40:45,180
So I had to sneak away.

466
00:40:46,980 --> 00:40:48,140
If His Majesty dares to teach it,

467
00:40:48,820 --> 00:40:50,900
he must have learned it
thoroughly himself.

468
00:40:52,100 --> 00:40:53,340
You taught Si'er

469
00:40:53,740 --> 00:40:55,220
the Mencius yourself, Scholar Yan.

470
00:40:55,980 --> 00:40:56,740
How could he not know it well?

471
00:41:00,420 --> 00:41:01,460
So many poems and essays.

472
00:41:03,460 --> 00:41:05,620
Are these all
this year's scholars' portfolios?

473
00:41:06,500 --> 00:41:06,900
Yes.

474
00:41:08,780 --> 00:41:09,900
Any promising talents?

475
00:41:11,500 --> 00:41:12,540
Their scholarship is solid,

476
00:41:13,340 --> 00:41:14,500
but they need further deliberation.

477
00:41:16,860 --> 00:41:17,900
Consider them carefully.

478
00:41:19,180 --> 00:41:19,820
Of course.

479
00:41:20,740 --> 00:41:21,780
Stop talking to me now.

480
00:41:22,020 --> 00:41:23,260
I have so many memorials to read.

481
00:42:16,060 --> 00:42:17,100
The roads are slippery in the snow.

482
00:42:18,020 --> 00:42:19,060
We'll have to get up early

483
00:42:20,180 --> 00:42:21,220
for court tomorrow.

484
00:42:24,700 --> 00:42:25,380
I'll wake you.

485
00:42:41,940 --> 00:42:42,780
(Yan Shang and I)

486
00:42:43,460 --> 00:42:44,860
(once agreed we'd retire together.)

487
00:42:46,060 --> 00:42:47,220
(But the wilds, for all their beauty,)

488
00:42:47,980 --> 00:42:48,820
(are not where my heart lies.)

489
00:42:50,500 --> 00:42:51,060
(Sheng'an)

490
00:42:51,820 --> 00:42:52,620
(is my home)

491
00:42:53,700 --> 00:42:54,580
(and my battlefield.)

492
00:42:56,140 --> 00:42:57,260
(I will stay here,)

493
00:42:58,500 --> 00:42:59,940
(with Go and sword,)

494
00:43:00,780 --> 00:43:01,500
(till my last breath.)

495
00:43:03,300 --> 00:43:04,060
(No need to turn back.)

496
00:43:05,340 --> 00:43:06,140
(Just lift my eyes,)

497
00:43:07,300 --> 00:43:08,860
(and he's there beside me.)

498
00:43:09,780 --> 00:43:10,620
(We stand side by side.)

499
00:43:13,460 --> 00:43:14,100
(Together,)

500
00:43:15,580 --> 00:43:16,340
(we protect our city)

501
00:43:17,780 --> 00:43:18,580
(and help our nation thrive.)

502
00:43:21,100 --> 00:43:22,220
(A life well spent.)

503
00:44:00,620 --> 00:44:07,520
(The End)

504
00:44:10,360 --> 00:44:13,653
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

505
00:44:16,338 --> 00:44:21,254
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

506
00:44:23,448 --> 00:44:29,293
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

507
00:44:29,793 --> 00:44:35,019
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

508
00:44:37,788 --> 00:44:42,579
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

509
00:44:43,415 --> 00:44:49,494
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

510
00:44:51,295 --> 00:44:54,445
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

511
00:44:54,445 --> 00:44:56,093
♪Burning bright as a song♪

512
00:44:56,145 --> 00:44:59,869
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

513
00:45:00,247 --> 00:45:04,913
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

514
00:45:05,532 --> 00:45:09,573
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

515
00:45:10,064 --> 00:45:12,179
♪Not a single hour less♪

516
00:45:12,219 --> 00:45:19,165
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

517
00:45:19,928 --> 00:45:23,381
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

518
00:45:23,561 --> 00:45:26,706
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

519
00:45:27,145 --> 00:45:33,782
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

520
00:45:34,179 --> 00:45:36,217
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

521
00:45:36,217 --> 00:45:38,693
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

522
00:45:38,731 --> 00:45:41,200
♪You're the only one I need♪

523
00:45:41,404 --> 00:45:48,291
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

524
00:45:48,603 --> 00:45:51,874
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

525
00:45:52,179 --> 00:45:55,352
♪My last untouched innocence♪

526
00:45:55,676 --> 00:45:59,102
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

527
00:45:59,335 --> 00:46:02,560
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

528
00:46:02,891 --> 00:46:09,687
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

529
00:46:10,056 --> 00:46:12,118
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

530
00:46:12,119 --> 00:46:14,622
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

531
00:46:14,669 --> 00:46:17,007
♪You're the only one I need♪

532
00:46:17,238 --> 00:46:24,073
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

533
00:46:24,422 --> 00:46:26,040
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

534
00:46:26,170 --> 00:46:27,966
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

535
00:46:28,323 --> 00:46:31,340
♪You're the only one I need♪

536
00:46:31,380 --> 00:46:32,707
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

